# Deleting containers, cluster objects, cloud resources or an infrastructure
# stack is `destroy_resources`; listing, describing, creating and rehearsing
# are safe, and a command only known when it runs is `unknown`. One section
# per kind of tool, then the lines that wrap or run them, PowerShell and cmd,
# and the reason a prompt can show. How the words of such a line are read
# (options, rehearsals, variables, loops) is in
# `destroy_resources_options.cases`. The format is in CONTRIBUTING.md.

